<LegalLayout
    title="Accessibility guide"
    description="Cmdr's accessibility features and how to turn them on: keyboard-only use, VoiceOver, text size and zoom, light and dark mode, Reduce motion, and Reduce transparency. Plus the known gaps, and how to get help."
    lastUpdated="2026-10-15"
>
    <DevTodo>
